 s they discuss their worst drunken nights out\, do standup\, and eventually
  end the night and perform a set…not so sober with an additional catch. T
 he comics will be forced to do improv on crowd sourced topics. It's part ha
 ngout\, part show\, part live podcast\, and totally a fantastic time. It's 
